ogue: 0,0:02:36.21,0:02:37.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry to the execution platform!Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.64,0:02:41.57,Main,,0,0,0,,The Giant Squad is coming!Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.14,0:02:45.48,Main,,0,0,0,,They're targeting Little Oars Jr.!Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.33,0:02:50.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Stopping that thing...Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.46,0:02:52.05,Main,,0,0,0,,... is our duty!Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.99,0:02:58.06,Main,,0,0,0,,His size is unbelievable...Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.06,0:03:01.09,Main,,0,0,0,,He's more than twice as large as any ordinary Giant!Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.09,0:03:02.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Keep shooting!Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.54,0:03:05.94,Main,,0,0,0,,He's only flesh and blood... he can't be invulnerable!Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.94,0:03:21.01,Main,,0,0,0,,They brought one hell of an ally.Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.68,0:03:25.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Fire! Shoot him down!Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.82,0:03:29.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Oars! Forget about it!Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.90,0:03:33.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Your size makes you too easy a target!Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.12,0:03:35.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.63,0:03:45.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm coming for ya!Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.01,0:03:56.63,Main,,0,0,0,,This is bad!Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.63,0:03:57.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop him!Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.10,0:04:16.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Oars opened a path into the bay!Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.20,0:04:21.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Invade the bay!Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.49,0:04:30.03,Captions,,0,0,0,,OarsDialogue: 0,0:04:26.49,0:04:30.03,Captions,,0,0,0,,PlazaDialogue: 0,0:04:26.49,0:04:30.03,Captions,,0,0,0,,The Seven WarlordsDialogue: 0,0:04:30.26,0:04:33.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Fall back! Fortify the shoreline!Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.21,0:04:34.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't let them reach the plaza!Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.20,0:04:46.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I've never had to look up at someone before!Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.29,0:04:47.60,Main,,0,0,0,,You said it!Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.60,0:04:49.56,Main,,0,0,0,,This is as far as you get!Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.82,0:05:12.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Lacroix!Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.15,0:05:19.16,Main,,0,0,0,,That Oars... No point trying to hold him back...Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.75,0:05:22.40,Main,,0,0,0,,There's a difference between being a hero and throwing your life away!Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.11,0:05:27.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Old Man, please don't stop me!Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.38,0:05:30.11,Main,,0,0,0,,I wanna save 'im!Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.11,0:05:35.78,Main,,0,0,0,,I wanna save Ace-kun as fast as possible!Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.61,0:05:38.98,Main,,0,0,0,,I hear ya.Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.98,0:05:44.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Men! Wipe your asses! Let's give Oars some support!Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.41,0:05:45.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.60,0:05:53.13,Main,,0,0,0,,How do we fight a guy this big?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.37,0:06:02.52,Main,,0,0,0,,How dare you hurt Vice Admiral Lacroix!Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.59,0:06:23.60,Main,,0,0,0,,If you get distracted by Oars, I'll take you down!Dialogue: 1,0:06:30.14,0:06:30.64,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,SDialogue: 1,0:06:30.18,0:06:30.64,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,lDialogue: 1,0:06:30.22,0:06:30.64,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 1,0:06:30.64,0:06:31.36,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,SlaDialogue: 1,0:06:30.26,0:06:31.06,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,vDialogue: 1,0:06:30.30,0:06:31.06,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 1,0:06:31.06,0:06:31.66,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,veDialogue: 1,0:06:30.34,0:06:31.36,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,ADialogue: 1,0:06:30.38,0:06:31.36,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 1,0:06:31.36,0:06:31.87,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,ArDialogue: 1,0:06:30.42,0:06:31.57,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 1,0:06:30.46,0:06:31.57,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,oDialogue: 1,0:06:30.50,0:06:31.57,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,wDialogue: 1,0:06:31.57,0:06:32.30,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,rowDialogue: 0,0:06:42.12,0:06:44.49,Main,,0,0,0,,H-Hey! Guys!Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.13,0:06:47.64,Main,,0,0,0,,The Pirate Empress, I'm guessing?Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.33,0:06:54.83,Main,,0,0,0,,My body's... crumbling?!Dialogue: 1,0:06:54.82,0:06:55.32,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,PDialogue: 1,0:06:54.86,0:06:55.32,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 1,0:06:54.90,0:06:55.32,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 1,0:06:55.32,0:06:55.86,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,PerDialogue: 1,0:06:54.94,0:06:55.56,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,fDialogue: 1,0:06:54.98,0:06:55.56,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,uDialogue: 1,0:06:55.56,0:06:56.07,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,fuDialogue: 1,0:06:55.02,0:06:55.77,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,mDialogue: 1,0:06:55.06,0:06:55.77,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 1,0:06:55.77,0:06:56.59,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,meDialogue: 1,0:06:55.10,0:06:56.29,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,FDialogue: 1,0:06:55.14,0:06:56.29,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 1,0:06:56.29,0:06:56.78,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,FeDialogue: 1,0:06:55.18,0:06:56.48,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,mDialogue: 1,0:06:55.22,0:06:56.48,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,uDialogue: 1,0:06:56.48,0:06:56.88,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,muDialogue: 1,0:06:55.26,0:06:56.58,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 1,0:06:56.58,0:06:57.11,Hancock,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 0,0:07:11.68,0:07:15.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! What do you think you're doing, attacking marines?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.21,0:07:19.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I agreed to fight against Whitebeard...Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.33,0:07:22.52,Main,,0,0,0,,but I never said I would be your ally.Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.32,0:07:26.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Whether enemies or friends, all men are the same!Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.41,0:07:29.24,Main,,0,0,0,,All but one man...Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.73,0:07:34.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I want to leave here with my promise fulfilled.Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.33,0:07:35.57,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.43,0:07:42.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Can you forgive this beauty?Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.41,0:07:45.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Y-You...!Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.46,0:08:00.82,Main,,0,0,0,,You!Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.98,0:08:20.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll save ya now!Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.42,0:08:22.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Oars...Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.20,0:08:56.20,Kuma,,0,0,0,fx,UDialogue: 0,0:08:56.20,0:08:56.20,Kuma,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 1,0:08:56.20,0:08:56.83,Kuma,,0,0,0,fx,UrDialogue: 0,0:08:56.30,0:08:57.84,Kuma,,0,0,0,fx,UrDialogue: 0,0:08:56.23,0:08:56.63,Kuma,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 0,0:08:56.23,0:08:56.63,Kuma,,0,0,0,fx,uDialogue: 0,0:08:56.23,0:08:56.63,Kuma,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 1,0:08:56.63,0:08:57.35,Kuma,,0,0,0,fx,susDialogue: 0,0:08:56.73,0:08:57.84,Kuma,,0,0,0,fx,susDialogue: 0,0:08:56.26,0:08:57.15,Kuma,,0,0,0,fx,SDialogue: 0,0:08:56.26,0:08:57.15,Kuma,,0,0,0,fx,hDialogue: 0,0:08:56.26,0:08:57.15,Kuma,,0,0,0,fx,oDialogue: 1,0:08:57.15,0:08:57.73,Kuma,,0,0,0,fx,ShoDialogue: 0,0:08:57.25,0:08:57.84,Kuma,,0,0,0,fx,ShoDialogue: 0,0:08:56.29,0:08:57.53,Kuma,,0,0,0,fx,cDialogue: 0,0:08:56.29,0:08:57.53,Kuma,,0,0,0,fx,kDialogue: 1,0:08:57.53,0:08:58.04,Kuma,,0,0,0,fx,ckDialogue: 0,0:08:57.63,0:08:57.84,Kuma,,0,0,0,fx,ckDialogue: 0,0:09:16.57,0:09:18.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Oars!Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.51,0:09:31.31,Main,,0,0,0,,That's enough! Stop this!Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.16,0:09:34.29,Main,,0,0,0,,You won't make it this far!Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.48,0:09:38.10,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Me?Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.89,0:09:45.06,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I learned how to make it in the Wano Country.Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.84,0:09:47.49,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Try it on!Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.16,0:09:53.28,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Ace-san burned the darn thing twice trying to make that hat.Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.28,0:09:56.71,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,A fire man like him shouldn't be weaving straw.Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.42,0:10:03.18,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Whoa! It's much cooler now!Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.00,0:10:05.95,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Really? Great!Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.16,0:10:18.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Aim for Oars!Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.71,0:10:30.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Oars!Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.32,0:10:32.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I guess there was no chance.Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.04,0:10:33.41,Main,,0,0,0,,He's such a big target!Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.94,0:10:42.74,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Captain Oars!Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.74,0:10:44.90,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,What are you doing outside?Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.30,0:10:49.73,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Hmm... I don't even get wet by the rain...Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.74,0:10:52.98,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,It's really sturdy.Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.98,0:10:55.34,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,This is great!Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.74,0:11:02.28,Main,,0,0,0,,At the very least...Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.28,0:11:06.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if it's just one of the Warlords...Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.77,0:11:28.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong, demon?Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.86,0:11:30.30,Main,,0,0,0,,My legs won't...Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.51,0:11:32.87,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Captain!Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.95,0:11:37.62,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Captain! Why are you outside again?Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.62,0:11:41.11,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,The snow doesn't even reach me.Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.86,0:11:44.10,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm not cold at all!Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.22,0:11:47.34,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,This is really good!Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.77,0:11:50.42,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Ace-Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.24,0:12:01.95,Main,,0,0,0,,How fun!Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.87,0:12:09.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Oars!Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.74,0:12:29.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I-It's the monster!Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.63,0:12:35.47,Main,,0,0,0,,He's breached the plaza!Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.34,0:12:46.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Just a little more...Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.07,0:12:54.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Just a little further to Ace-kun...Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.34,0:13:03.15,Main,,0,0,0,,That Doflamingo bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.15,0:13:05.46,Main,,0,0,0,,He's gone and cut off a leg!Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.46,0:13:08.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Even though I said I wanted the corpse...Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.41,0:13:09.56,Moria,,0,0,0,fx,m 12 0 b 25 0 22 13 12 13 b 2 13 2 0 12 0 DDialogue: 0,0:13:08.41,0:13:09.56,Moria,,0,0,0,fx,m 12 0 b 25 0 22 13 12 13 b 2 13 2 0 12 0 DDialogue: 0,0:13:08.41,0:13:09.56,Moria,,0,0,0,fx,m 20 0 b 44 0 38 29 20 28 b -1 28 0 0 20 0 DDialogue: 0,0:13:08.41,0:13:09.56,Moria,,0,0,0,fx,m 12 0 b 25 0 22 13 12 13 b 2 13 2 0 12 0 DDialogue: 0,0:13:08.41,0:13:09.56,Moria,,0,0,0,fx,m 12 0 b 25 0 22 13 12 13 b 2 13 2 0 12 0 DDialogue: 0,0:13:08.41,0:13:09.56,Moria,,0,0,0,fx,m 20 0 b 44 0 38 29 20 28 b -1 28 0 0 20 0 DDialogue: 0,0:13:08.41,0:1