,0,0,fx,zDialogue: 1,0:13:13.95,0:13:14.29,Moria,,0,0,0,fx,zDialogue: 1,0:13:13.95,0:13:14.29,Moria,,0,0,0,fx,zDialogue: 1,0:13:13.96,0:13:14.29,Moria,,0,0,0,fx,zDialogue: 1,0:13:13.96,0:13:14.29,Moria,,0,0,0,fx,zDialogue: 1,0:13:13.97,0:13:14.29,Moria,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 1,0:13:13.97,0:13:14.29,Moria,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 1,0:13:13.98,0:13:14.29,Moria,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 1,0:13:13.98,0:13:14.29,Moria,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 1,0:13:13.99,0:13:14.29,Moria,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 1,0:13:13.99,0:13:14.29,Moria,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 1,0:13:14.00,0:13:14.29,Moria,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 1,0:13:14.00,0:13:14.29,Moria,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 1,0:13:14.01,0:13:14.29,Moria,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 1,0:13:14.01,0:13:14.29,Moria,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 1,0:13:14.02,0:13:14.29,Moria,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 1,0:13:14.02,0:13:14.29,Moria,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 1,0:13:14.03,0:13:14.29,Moria,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 1,0:13:14.03,0:13:14.29,Moria,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 1,0:13:14.04,0:13:14.29,Moria,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 1,0:13:14.04,0:13:14.29,Moria,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 1,0:13:14.05,0:13:14.29,Moria,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 1,0:13:14.05,0:13:14.29,Moria,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 1,0:13:14.06,0:13:14.29,Moria,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 1,0:13:14.06,0:13:14.29,Moria,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 1,0:13:14.07,0:13:14.29,Moria,,0,0,0,fx,dDialogue: 1,0:13:14.07,0:13:14.29,Moria,,0,0,0,fx,dDialogue: 1,0:13:14.08,0:13:14.29,Moria,,0,0,0,fx,dDialogue: 1,0:13:14.08,0:13:14.29,Moria,,0,0,0,fx,dDialogue: 1,0:13:14.09,0:13:14.29,Moria,,0,0,0,fx,dDialogue: 1,0:13:14.09,0:13:14.29,Moria,,0,0,0,fx,dDialogue: 1,0:13:14.10,0:13:14.29,Moria,,0,0,0,fx,dDialogue: 1,0:13:14.10,0:13:14.29,Moria,,0,0,0,fx,dDialogue: 1,0:13:14.11,0:13:14.29,Moria,,0,0,0,fx,dDialogue: 1,0:13:14.11,0:13:14.29,Moria,,0,0,0,fx,dDialogue: 0,0:13:17.27,0:13:19.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Oars!Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.26,0:13:37.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Look! This is the right way to kill someone!Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.66,0:13:39.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain Oars!Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.56,0:13:42.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn the Seven Warlords!Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.80,0:13:43.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain!Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.90,0:13:45.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Oars!Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.92,0:14:15.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Oars!Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.98,0:14:38.32,Main,,0,0,0,,If I use his corpse, I can create the ultimate zombie warrior!Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.93,0:14:50.43,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Oars...Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.74,0:14:53.94,Main,,0,0,0,,You're wide open, Whitebeard!Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.72,0:15:08.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Ronse!Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.67,0:15:22.80,Main,,0,0,0,,H-He beat a Giant -Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.80,0:15:26.07,Main,,0,0,0,,and a Navy HQ vice admiral at that - effortlessly!Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.91,0:15:38.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Charge across Oars!Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.29,0:15:43.29,Captions,,0,0,20,,Marineford - Inside the BayDialogue: 0,0:16:07.20,0:16:09.66,Main,,0,0,0,,This is priceless!Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.66,0:16:12.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo! How could you do that to Oars?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.84,0:16:14.99,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't let you get away with this!Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.41,0:16:17.59,Main,,0,0,0,,What's so funny?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.59,0:16:19.69,Main,,0,0,0,,You wanna know what's so funny?Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.69,0:16:22.21,Main,,0,0,0,,This feeling of being right at the center of an era, that's what!Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.60,0:16:27.26,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the turning point!Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.26,0:16:29.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Quit spouting nonsense!Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.05,0:16:32.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Just as I'd expect of the commander!Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.61,0:16:34.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo is running away from him!Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.70,0:16:47.34,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Impossible! This is just too much for me!Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.34,0:16:49.50,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I'm too scared to do anything!Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.50,0:16:53.21,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,So many strong people are falling, one after another!Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.21,0:16:55.64,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,There's nothing I can do here!Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.64,0:16:56.89,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Someone like me can't...Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.34,0:16:59.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait, Koby! If you're running away, then I'm coming with you!Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.28,0:17:02.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Return to the battlefield!Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.45,0:17:07.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Let me go! Please!Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.72,0:17:11.94,Main,,0,0,0,,It's Admiral Akainu! What's he doing here?Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.94,0:17:16.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid of dying! When I think of my family, I can't even move!Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.38,0:17:19.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Please! I'm begging you! Please!Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.50,0:17:23.78,Main,,0,0,0,,We marines...Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.20,0:17:30.22,Main,,0,0,0,,fight against pirates and carry the justice of the world on our backs.Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.79,0:17:34.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Someone who runs away and lets an enemy see his back...Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.91,0:17:37.73,Main,,0,0,0,,has no right to call himself a marine!Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.73,0:17:39.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Someone like that is merely...Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.97,0:17:41.22,Main,,0,0,0,,trash!Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.49,0:17:48.24,Main,,0,0,0,,If you truly cared for your family,Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.24,0:17:50.15,Main,,0,0,0,,you wouldn't have disgraced them like this!Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.80,0:17:59.12,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,N-No way! How could he do that to an ally?Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.77,0:18:04.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Admiral Sakazuki! We've finished preparing for the operation.Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.74,0:18:07.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Have you now? Finally!Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.10,0:18:15.61,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Operation?Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.88,0:18:19.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.36,0:18:24.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Commander Atmos!Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.37,0:18:25.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Why...Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.49,0:18:28.70,Main,,0,0,0,,My body's not listening to me...Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.70,0:18:30.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop this, Doflamingo!Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.62,0:18:42.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Pirates are evil? The Navy is righteous?Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.43,0:18:44.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Those views change as often as the tides!Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.85,0:18:51.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Kids who've never known peace have different values from those who've never known war.Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.96,0:18:56.40,Main,,0,0,0,,It's the job of those at the top to decide what's good and what's evil.Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.40,0:19:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,This place is the turning point.Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.86,0:19:05.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Justice will triumph, you say?Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.25,0:19:07.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Why of course!Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.57,0:19:13.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Because the winners will become justice!Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.83,0:19:17.13,Captions,,0,0,20,,Marineford - Bay HeadDialogue: 0,0:19:14.83,0:19:17.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't let them close the path Oars has opened!Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.40,0:19:20.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Advance into the bay!Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.61,0:19:24.14,Main,,0,0,0,,An icebreaker?Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.89,0:19:27.19,Main,,0,0,0,,It's the Ice Witch, Whitey Bay!Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.19,0:19:30.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Nothing to it.Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.13,0:19:32.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, all of you! Let's go!Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.73,0:19:34.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks!Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.40,0:19:36.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Come on, men! Forward, into the bay!Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.03,0:19:44.63,Main,,0,0,0,,The bay's been breached in two spots!Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.08,0:19:49.48,Main,,0,0,0,,The Whitebeard Pirates and their allies are surging through both openings,Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.48,0:19:54.33,Main,,0,0,0,,and they're attacking the bay in large numbers, Fleet Admiral Sengoku!Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.33,0:19:55.57,Main,,0,0,0,,That's not a problem.Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.57,0:19:56.27,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.50,0:20:01.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Tsuru-san, commence the operation.Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.26,0:20:02.84,Main,,0,0,0,,At last.Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.26,0:20:04.23,Captions,,0,0,20,,Marineford - Bay HeadDialogue: 0,0:20:02.84,0:20:06.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Move it! Or you'll be more than just wounded!Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.09,0:20:07.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Move it, old woman!Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.31,0:20:10.56,Main,,0,0,0,,I've been washed!Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.56,0:20:12.02,Main,,0,0,0,,I've been hung out to dry!Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.02,0:20:14.12,Main,,0,0,0,,But it feels so nice!Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.12,0:20:17.13,Main,,0,0,0,,You're a million years too young to stand a chance against me.Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.14,0:20:20.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Calling all ships and all men!Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.92,0:20:37.63,Main,,0,0,0,,You're planning something, aren't you?Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.07,0:20:41.52,Main,,0,0,0,,The Resourceful General, Sengoku the Buddha.Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.68,0:20:46.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Gramps!Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.72,0:20:51.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Why have you come here? Do you wish to protest against my plan?Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.53,0:20:56.67,Main,,0,0,0,,No, we're up against pirates. There's no room for sympathy.Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.00,0:20:57.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Then...Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.81,0:20:58.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Be silent!Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.17,0:21:02.70,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't mind, right?Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.09,0:21:06.81,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm just gonna sit here.Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.85,0:21:19.26,Main,,0,0,0,,You idiot! You too?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.26,0:21:21.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't hit Luffy, you damn geezer!Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.99,0:21:23.16,Main,,0,0,0,,"Damn"?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.16,0:21:25.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace, how dare you?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.40,0:21:30.45,Main,,0,0,0,,I have no sympathy for criminals...Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.22,0:21:36.81,Main,,0,0,0,,but for my family, I do.Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.57,0:21:42.76,Main,,0,0,0,,What... should I do?Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.26,0:21:51.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn you Ace! Why couldn't you just live as I told you?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.05,0:22:05.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace...Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.40,0:22:11.18,Main,,0,0,0,,You two are gonna become strong marines.Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.16,0:22:14.87,Main,,0,0,0,,You got that?Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.78,0:22:18.66,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You're gonna become strong marines.Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.72,0:22:27.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Gramps...!Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.87,0:22:41.47,Main,,0,0,0,,If you cause some sort of commotion here, I won't show you any mercy, Garp.Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.04,0:22:45.94,Main,,0,0,0,,If I was gonna do something, I'd have done it already.Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.86,0:22:50.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you hear their plan just now, Helmeppo-san?Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.09,0:22:50.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah...Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.85,0:22:54.97,Main,,0,0,0,,They're gonna ignore Fire Fist Ace's scheduled execution time and just kill him now!Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.97,0:22:56.62,Main,,0,0,0,,If they do that...Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.79,0:22:59.36,Main,,0,0,0,,What's that?Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.29,0:23:05.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that...?Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.36,0:23:06.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Something's falling out of the sky!Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.99,0:23:10.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Is it a sneak attack from the Whitebeard Pirates?Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.74,0:23:35.59,Main,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd overdo it!Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.59,0:23:37.06,Main,,0,0,0,,This is all because of his wink.Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.06,0:23:39.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Vyou're blaming this on vme, Croco?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.49,0:23:41.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Who cares?! We're gonna die!Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.44,0:23:43.62,Main,,0,0,0,,The sea beneath us is frozen solid!Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.23,0:23:55.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh! I'm made of rubber, so I'll be fine!Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.91,0:23:58.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Then you'll be the only survivor!Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.04,0:23:59.85,Main,,0,0,0,,We have to do something!Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.85,0:24:02.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Vi don't want to die like this!Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.30,0:24:04.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Someone, stop vus!Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.09,0:24:08.19,Main,,0,0,0,,I never should've listened to you, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.19,0:24:09.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.40,0:24:15.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace!